# MightyTips.com – Complete Website Build

Build a full MightyTips.com clone as a **Next.js 14 (App Router)** application using React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. All content will be powered by rich mock/static data (no backend required). The site will be visually stunning, fully responsive, and animated.

