## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
None (no backend); visual/functional verification via browser.

### Manual Verification
1. Run `npm run dev` in `c:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\Mightytips Code`
2. Open `http://localhost:3000` in browser
3. Check each homepage section renders correctly
4. Test navigation mega-menu hover dropdowns on desktop
5. Resize to mobile (≤768px) — verify hamburger menu, single-column layout
6. Click "Copy promo code" — verify clipboard toast appears
7. Wait 3 seconds — verify promo popup appears
8. Navigate to `/football-predictions`, `/bookmakers`, `/news` pages
9. Click an author card → verify author profile page renders
10. Click a news article → verify article detail page renders

