### Design System & Sync
- The admin dashboard will use a clean, modern, and dark-themed UI (with a toggleable light/dark mode if requested) using Tailwind CSS and components similar to Shadcn UI.
- **Frontend-Backend Synchronization**: While currently powered by local mock data arrays in `lib/data`, the admin UI will be built conceptually to manage this data. Since we cannot persist data to a database yet, we will use React State/Context or local storage within the admin dashboard to simulate CRUD operations dynamically for the demonstration.

